%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 12550e90c236e0541b910f7291e37631, type: 3}
  m_Name: Boss
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueFinal
  Node:
  - sentences:
    - text: "Yer back! An\u2019 my ship is still in one piece! Glad t\u2019see it,
        newbie!"
    - text: "Right, well y\u2019know \u2018ow we reward a job well-done \u2018ere
        at Universal Parcel Service, doncha? With more jobs to\u2019do well fer\u2019us!"
    - text: "So! Geddon back o\u2019there! Yer next assignment will require more
        STEP and less PEP. That means no messin\u2019 around, newbie!"
    - text: "Make sure yer checkin\u2019 yer ship log for delivery details. Wouldn\u2019
        want to make yer customer mad with a wrong delivery!"
    - text: "Get that package where it needs to go on that great big green hunk a\u2019dirt
        Drasil fast as ye can! That is if ye wanna get paid, anyway\u2026"
  - sentences:
    - text: "Back already? Hmph, not bad, newbie. Nuthin\u2019 I like t\u2019see
        more than company time bein\u2019 used right!"
    - text: "In fact, I reckin\u2019 I\u2019ll have ya take care\u2019a a delivery
        nonna the guys \u2018round \u2018ere like doing. Now don\u2019t get all fussed,
        I ain\u2019t punishin\u2019 ya, I just want to see how ye\u2019ll handle
        it."
    - text: "This \u2018ere package needs to go to a bit o\u2019 a strange lad over
        on Orbitron. \u2018e lives a bit outta the way, and ye\u2019ll need to do
        some hoppin\u2019 around to get to \u2018em."
    - text: "Ye\u2019 may even need to toss that package a\u2019 \u2018is around
        a\u2019wittle to get it where it needs going. Don\u2019 worry, it\u2019s
        not as fragile as the last one, so long as you ain\u2019t slammin\u2019 it
        around it\u2019ll be fine!"
    - text: "Right, well, GO! Now\u2019s yer chance to prove yerself to me newbie,
        don\u2019t screw it up!"
  - sentences:
    - text: "Wow, yer really starting to impress me, newbie. Yer makin\u2019 us tons
        o\u2019 money!"
    - text: "Let\u2019s see what else I can give ye\u2026Ah! \u2018Ere, a special
        one just fer ye, to test yer knowledge o\u2019 Drasil an\u2019 allat."
    - text: "There\u2019s a pretty unique lil\u2019 fella somewhere on Drasil that
        needs a package from ye. \u2018Ey\u2019re a sneaky lil creature, an\u2019
        also pretty shy."
    - text: "Ye\u2019ll have to throw up the package t\u2019 them when ye find them.
        Make sure ye aim well! Give \u2018em a good ol\u2019 bonk. Now off witcha!"
  - sentences:
    - text: Well well well, ye really are a prodigy. Some fiiinnee work today, newbie,
        real fine work.
    - text: "Now, I\u2019ve got one more package fer ya. A very special package fer
        a very special guy!"
    - text: "I\u2018m trusting ye with the big stuff. Don\u2019t screw it up! I want
        a perfect delivery \u2018ere, so lock in!"
    - text: "But be kind t\u2019 it as well, \u2018cause if it gets busted up\u2026well,
        it won\u2019t be very pleased witcha."
    - text: "That\u2019s it, newbie. Get this last package where it needs t\u2019
        go and yer done. Now, if you\u2019ve got any questions about the package
        as you\u2019re deliverin\u2019 it, forget\u2018em."
    - text: "All you gotta think about is getting that package delivered alright?
        I\u2019ll see ya soon, yeah?"
    - text: "Just DO NOT screw this delivery up, an\u2019 yer bound for success here
        at UPS, I gurrentee it."
